{{#> layout title=title page=page}}{{#*inline "content"}}
{{> components/page-header title=title subtitle="Inventory, observed adoption, accounting coverage and outcome evidence."}}
<nav aria-label="Resource analysis"><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="?kind=skills">Skills</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="?kind=plugins">Plugins</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="?kind=marketplaces">Marketplaces</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary" href="/admin/analysis/campaigns">Optimization campaigns</a></nav>
<form class="sp-analysis-filters" method="get"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="{{kind}}"><label>From (UTC)<input name="start" value="{{start}}" required></label><label>Until (exclusive)<input name="end" value="{{end}}" required></label><label>Find a resource<input name="search" value="{{search}}"></label><button class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary">Apply</button></form>
<p>Generated {{generated_at}}. {{totals.invocations}} observed invocations; {{totals.users}} users; {{totals.priced_requests}} / {{totals.requests}} related requests have recorded costs. Unused resources remain visible. Unknown measurements are not zero.</p>
{{#if membership_associated}}<p role="note">Marketplace measurements describe traffic associated with current plugin membership. Historical marketplace membership is not yet established by these events.</p>{{/if}}
<div class="sp-table"><div class="sp-table__scroll"><table class="sp-table__el"><thead><tr><th>Resource</th><th>Uses / users</th><th>Version verified</th><th>Requests measured</th><th>Average tokens / request</th><th>Related cost</th><th>Failed requests</th><th>Latency (ms)</th><th>Assessed outcomes</th><th>Quality</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{#each rows}}<tr><td><a href="{{href}}">{{name}}</a><br>{{id}}{{#unless enabled}} · Disabled{{/unless}}<br><small>{{source}}</small></td><td>{{metrics.invocations}} / {{metrics.users}}</td><td>{{metrics.verified_invocations}} / {{metrics.invocations}}</td><td>{{metrics.measured_requests}} / {{metrics.requests}}</td><td>{{#if average_tokens}}{{average_tokens}}{{else}}Unknown{{/if}}</td><td>{{#if cost}}{{cost}}{{else}}Unknown{{/if}}<br>{{metrics.priced_requests}} priced</td><td>{{metrics.failed_requests}}</td><td>{{#if latency}}{{latency}}{{else}}Unknown{{/if}}</td><td>{{metrics.successful_conversations}} successful / {{metrics.assessed_conversations}} assessed</td><td>{{#if quality}}{{quality}}{{else}}Not assessed{{/if}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="10">No configured resources match this search.</td></tr>{{/each}}
</tbody></table></div></div>
<p>Each request is counted once within a row. Conversation-associated costs overlap across resources and must not be summed. Token averages use requests with both input and output measurements; reasoning tokens are included in output. Costs include recorded failed attempts. Session assessments are counted once per conversation and are observational evidence.</p>
<p>Legacy request storage defaults cost to zero without a pricing-completeness marker. These ambiguous zero values are shown as unknown, not as proof of free usage. Reload this page to query the latest retained events.</p>
{{/inline}}{{/layout}}
